Here is the commit message:
bugfix for 3661e14674124de2026216682372d9b99ae0fe28

Quantifiers are no Application terms any more.

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by treating quantifiers as application terms in the `Z3UnsafeFormulaManager`, which led to incorrect behavior when handling quantifiers in the Z3 solver. The logic did not properly distinguish between application terms and quantifiers, resulting in erroneous assumptions about their types and behavior.

Here is the patch:

